{"lines": [{"text": "This twenty-two-year-old earns over a hundred thousand dollars a year. But per hour, he makes less than you think.", "start": 0.15, "end": 6.318, "spec": {"img": 1, "ov": "hook"}, "words": [["This", 0.091, 0.239], ["twenty-two-year-old", 0.239, 1.114], ["earns", 1.295, 1.58], ["over", 1.591, 1.807], ["a", 1.807, 1.841], ["hundred", 1.841, 2.17], ["thousand", 2.182, 2.557], ["dollars", 2.557, 2.818], ["a", 2.83, 2.852], ["year", 2.864, 3.261], ["But", 3.636, 3.773], ["per", 3.784, 3.943], ["hour", 3.955, 4.33], ["he", 4.693, 4.739], ["makes", 4.739, 4.92], ["less", 4.932, 5.216], ["than", 5.216, 5.307], ["you", 5.318, 5.409], ["think", 5.409, 5.83]]}, {"text": "He is a first-year investment banker in New York.", "start": 6.618, "end": 9.21, "spec": {"img": 2, "ov": "who"}, "words": [["He", 0.102, 0.159], ["is", 0.159, 0.25], ["a", 0.25, 0.295], ["first-year", 0.295, 0.773], ["investment", 0.773, 1.182], ["banker", 1.182, 1.5], ["in", 1.693, 1.795], ["New", 1.795, 1.909], ["York", 1.909, 2.261]]}, {"text": "His job: helping giant companies buy each other, or go public on the stock market.", "start": 9.51, "end": 14.334, "spec": {"img": 3, "ov": "job"}, "words": [["His", 0.102, 0.216], ["job", 0.216, 0.591], ["helping", 1.068, 1.318], ["giant", 1.33, 1.67], ["companies", 1.682, 2.023], ["buy", 2.023, 2.17], ["each", 2.182, 2.375], ["other", 2.386, 2.682], ["or", 3.102, 3.193], ["go", 3.205, 3.364], ["public", 3.364, 3.693], ["on", 3.693, 3.761], ["the", 3.773, 3.818], ["stock", 3.818, 4.125], ["market", 4.125, 4.489]]}, {"text": "His base salary is over one hundred thousand dollars. With bonus, it can reach around two hundred thousand.", "start": 14.634, "end": 20.586, "spec": {"img": 4, "ov": "salary"}, "words": [["His", 0.091, 0.193], ["base", 0.205, 0.432], ["salary", 0.443, 0.92], ["is", 1.102, 1.273], ["over", 1.284, 1.5], ["one", 1.511, 1.727], ["hundred", 1.739, 2.0], ["thousand", 2.0, 2.307], ["dollars", 2.307, 2.83], ["With", 3.205, 3.352], ["bonus", 3.364, 3.966], ["it", 4.125, 4.17], ["can", 4.182, 4.284], ["reach", 4.295, 4.466], ["around", 4.466, 4.784], ["two", 4.795, 4.966], ["hundred", 4.966, 5.159], ["thousand", 5.159, 5.602]]}, {"text": "Sounds like a dream. But in a survey from twenty twenty-one, junior bankers at Goldman Sachs said they worked ninety-eight hours a week.", "start": 20.886, "end": 28.302, "spec": {"img": 5, "ov": "hours"}, "words": [["Sounds", 0.091, 0.239], ["like", 0.239, 0.33], ["a", 0.33, 0.375], ["dream", 0.386, 0.773], ["But", 1.148, 1.25], ["in", 1.25, 1.307], ["a", 1.307, 1.352], ["survey", 1.352, 1.795], ["from", 1.795, 1.966], ["twenty", 1.966, 2.227], ["twenty-one", 2.227, 2.739], ["junior", 3.102, 3.443], ["bankers", 3.443, 3.784], ["at", 3.784, 3.852], ["Goldman", 3.852, 4.182], ["Sachs", 4.182, 4.58], ["said", 4.705, 4.977], ["they", 5.227, 5.33], ["worked", 5.33, 5.602], ["ninety-eight", 5.602, 6.273], ["hours", 6.375, 6.648], ["a", 6.648, 6.693], ["week", 6.693, 7.08]]}, {"text": "Going to bed around three in the morning. Sleeping about five hours a night.", "start": 28.602, "end": 32.946, "spec": {"img": 6, "ov": "sleep"}, "words": [["Going", 0.091, 0.25], ["to", 0.25, 0.295], ["bed", 0.307, 0.5], ["around", 0.511, 0.852], ["three", 0.864, 1.42], ["in", 1.534, 1.625], ["the", 1.636, 1.682], ["morning", 1.682, 2.057], ["Sleeping", 2.42, 2.693], ["about", 2.693, 2.955], ["five", 2.966, 3.352], ["hours", 3.352, 3.625], ["a", 3.636, 3.659], ["night", 3.659, 4.011]]}, {"text": "Now divide that base salary by ninety-eight hours a week. That is about twenty-two dollars an hour.", "start": 33.246, "end": 38.67, "spec": {"img": 7, "ov": "hourly"}, "words": [["Now", 0.091, 0.261], ["divide", 0.273, 0.636], ["that", 0.636, 0.83], ["base", 0.83, 1.057], ["salary", 1.057, 1.5], ["by", 1.625, 1.716], ["ninety-eight", 1.716, 2.42], ["hours", 2.523, 2.773], ["a", 2.784, 2.83], ["week", 2.841, 3.239], ["That", 3.614, 3.693], ["is", 3.705, 3.773], ["about", 3.773, 3.989], ["twenty-two", 3.989, 4.398], ["dollars", 4.398, 4.693], ["an", 4.693, 4.761], ["hour", 4.761, 5.102]]}, {"text": "In that same survey, only about half expected to still be at the bank six months later.", "start": 38.97, "end": 44.346, "spec": {"img": 8, "ov": "quit"}, "words": [["In", 0.091, 0.148], ["that", 0.148, 0.295], ["same", 0.295, 0.58], ["survey", 0.58, 1.148], ["only", 1.534, 1.795], ["about", 1.795, 2.011], ["half", 2.011, 2.364], ["expected", 2.375, 2.977], ["to", 3.216, 3.284], ["still", 3.284, 3.568], ["be", 3.568, 3.716], ["at", 3.716, 3.784], ["the", 3.784, 3.852], ["bank", 3.852, 4.182], ["six", 4.182, 4.432], ["months", 4.432, 4.682], ["later", 4.682, 5.023]]}, {"text": "So why does anyone still want this job? Because the few who make it to the top can earn around a million dollars a year.", "start": 44.646, "end": 50.55, "spec": {"img": 9, "ov": "md"}, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.216], ["why", 0.227, 0.341], ["does", 0.352, 0.466], ["anyone", 0.477, 0.682], ["still", 0.693, 0.932], ["want", 0.943, 1.136], ["this", 1.136, 1.273], ["job", 1.284, 1.648], ["Because", 2.011, 2.273], ["the", 2.284, 2.375], ["few", 2.375, 2.58], ["who", 2.58, 2.659], ["make", 2.659, 2.841], ["it", 2.841, 2.886], ["to", 2.886, 2.955], ["the", 2.966, 3.045], ["top", 3.045, 3.375], ["can", 3.511, 3.636], ["earn", 3.636, 3.852], ["around", 3.852, 4.239], ["a", 4.364, 4.386], ["million", 4.386, 4.841], ["dollars", 4.841, 5.148], ["a", 5.148, 5.17], ["year", 5.17, 5.568]]}, {"text": "Would you trade your twenties for that? Tell me in the comments.", "start": 50.85, "end": 53.85, "spec": {"img": 9, "ov": "ask"}, "words": [["Would", 0.091, 0.182], ["you", 0.182, 0.261], ["trade", 0.261, 0.523], ["your", 0.534, 0.602], ["twenties", 0.602, 0.943], ["for", 0.955, 1.068], ["that", 1.068, 1.364], ["Tell", 1.739, 1.841], ["me", 1.841, 1.932], ["in", 1.932, 1.989], ["the", 1.989, 2.045], ["comments", 2.045, 2.659]]}], "dur": 55.45}